<title>UK: Eksportfinans sets 11.9 bln yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans sets 11.9 bln yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets Ltd, Tokyo-Mitsubishi International Plc and Sanyo International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   A/S EKSPORTFINANS</p>
<p> AMT    11.9 BLN YEN  COUPON     5.10	MATURITY    25.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  100.125   PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 500     SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	     REDEMPTION CURRENCY WILL BE STERLING</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
